.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH tine-query 1  "query " 
.SH NAME
tine\-query \- Run a query: an OG simple or advanced query, or TQL with \-\-tql
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBtine query\fR [\fB\-\-tql\fR] [\fB\-\-debug\fR] [\fB\-g\fR|\fB\-\-graph\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIQUERY\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Run a query: an OG simple or advanced query, or TQL with \-\-tql
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-tql\fR
QUERY is TQL, as in {{tine\-query …}}
.TP
\fB\-\-debug\fR
Enable diagnostic logging for the desktop app
.TP
\fB\-g\fR, \fB\-\-graph\fR \fI<GRAPH>\fR
The graph. Defaults to $TINE_GRAPH, else the graph folder around the current directory
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print the typed result (schema tine.cli/1) as JSON
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIQUERY\fR>

